  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "会说话是优势，会接话才是本事。一个会接话的人到底有多厉害？领导说鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。怎么说？领导，您看，鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。领导说，不喝就是看不起我怎么说？领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病。领导说来这么晚，只能吃剩菜了吧。怎么说，领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了。领导说，这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬。怎么说嘴硬，才守得住秘密，领导说，你这菜点的也太多了。怎么说，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，我先敬您。领导说，今天让你破费了。怎么说？领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教，不是领导说你酒量挺好的呀。怎么说？领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。领导说，这偶像藕是好藕啊，就是心眼太多了。怎么说？领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。领导说，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。怎么说个高是为了给领导探路走，哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？领导说，我真不怎么喜欢你怎么说，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。领导说你最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。怎么说？听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯。领导说，怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了。怎么说花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了，给领导倒酒，刚好只剩半杯了。领导说，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。怎么说？领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。领导说，年轻就是好啊，怎么说，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。领导说，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，怎么说？思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。领导说来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是外人怎么说，领导您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。当领导在客户面前夸你怎么说，火车跑得快，全靠车头带，还请领导继续培养提携。当领导夸你菜点的不错，怎么说？多谢领导赏识我点的只是菜，而领导您点的，可是公司前行的灯塔，别人夸你衣服真好看。怎么说？谢谢。因为今天要见你，所以穿的好看一点。老师，你是怎么做到见招拆招，既不显得拍马屁，还能让领导听了这么舒服的。因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，你要知道这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话，会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下无弱兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我欲解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 1230,
      "text": "会说话是优势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1470,
      "end_ms": 2850,
      "text": "会接话才是本事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3070,
      "end_ms": 5090,
      "text": "一个会接话的人到底有多厉害？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5090,
      "end_ms": 6450,
      "text": "领导说鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6530,
      "end_ms": 7590,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7610,
      "end_ms": 8050,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8250,
      "end_ms": 8550,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 8550,
      "end_ms": 8950,
      "text": "您看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 9250,
      "end_ms": 10330,
      "text": "鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 10390,
      "end_ms": 13110,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 13110,
      "end_ms": 13570,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 13570,
      "end_ms": 15290,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 15530,
      "end_ms": 15950,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 16290,
      "end_ms": 17330,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 17610,
      "end_ms": 18590,
      "text": "我是看不起病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 18970,
      "end_ms": 19970,
      "text": "领导说来这么晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 19970,
      "end_ms": 20950,
      "text": "只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 20950,
      "end_ms": 21370,
      "text": "怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 21450,
      "end_ms": 23310,
      "text": "领导饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 23470,
      "end_ms": 25650,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 25650,
      "end_ms": 27290,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 27290,
      "end_ms": 27750,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 27750,
      "end_ms": 29010,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 29150,
      "end_ms": 29875,
      "text": "就是嘴硬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 32340,
      "text": "怎么说嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 32500,
      "end_ms": 33880,
      "text": "才守得住秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 34040,
      "end_ms": 34600,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 34680,
      "end_ms": 35980,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 35980,
      "end_ms": 36420,
      "text": "怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 36740,
      "end_ms": 38500,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 38580,
      "end_ms": 41360,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 41400,
      "end_ms": 42140,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 42240,
      "end_ms": 42700,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 42700,
      "end_ms": 43660,
      "text": "今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 43660,
      "end_ms": 44120,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 44400,
      "end_ms": 44840,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 45400,
      "end_ms": 46780,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 46780,
      "end_ms": 47520,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 47780,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 49560,
      "end_ms": 51780,
      "text": "不是领导说你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 51780,
      "end_ms": 52220,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 52500,
      "end_ms": 52880,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 52880,
      "end_ms": 53940,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 53940,
      "end_ms": 55120,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 55320,
      "end_ms": 56800,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 56800,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 57480,
      "end_ms": 58960,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 59160,
      "end_ms": 59580,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 59580,
      "end_ms": 60830,
      "text": "这偶像藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 60830,
      "end_ms": 61910,
      "text": "就是心眼太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 61910,
      "end_ms": 62370,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 62570,
      "end_ms": 64590,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 64850,
      "end_ms": 66490,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 66570,
      "end_ms": 67070,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 67070,
      "end_ms": 68150,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 68150,
      "end_ms": 68870,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 68870,
      "end_ms": 71370,
      "text": "怎么说个高是为了给领导探路走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 71490,
      "end_ms": 73395,
      "text": "哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 75500,
      "end_ms": 76140,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 76180,
      "end_ms": 77940,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 78240,
      "end_ms": 80460,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 80460,
      "end_ms": 83030,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 83110,
      "end_ms": 84890,
      "text": "领导说你最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 84910,
      "end_ms": 86550,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 86550,
      "end_ms": 87630,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 87630,
      "end_ms": 88070,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 88410,
      "end_ms": 89190,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 89290,
      "end_ms": 90610,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 90710,
      "end_ms": 92170,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 92210,
      "end_ms": 92770,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 92850,
      "end_ms": 93910,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 94030,
      "end_ms": 95450,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 95450,
      "end_ms": 96950,
      "text": "怎么说花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 96970,
      "end_ms": 98505,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 98750,
      "end_ms": 100735,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 101830,
      "end_ms": 102690,
      "text": "给领导倒酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 102730,
      "end_ms": 103750,
      "text": "刚好只剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 103750,
      "end_ms": 104190,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 104190,
      "end_ms": 105330,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 105330,
      "end_ms": 105770,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 105930,
      "end_ms": 107590,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 107750,
      "end_ms": 109010,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 109130,
      "end_ms": 111395,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 111910,
      "end_ms": 112450,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 112470,
      "end_ms": 113470,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 113550,
      "end_ms": 113990,
      "text": "怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 114070,
      "end_ms": 115470,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 115650,
      "end_ms": 116850,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 117090,
      "end_ms": 118445,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 118810,
      "end_ms": 119250,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 119270,
      "end_ms": 120570,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 120570,
      "end_ms": 120990,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 121270,
      "end_ms": 123590,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 123810,
      "end_ms": 125965,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 126600,
      "end_ms": 127720,
      "text": "领导说来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 127720,
      "end_ms": 128580,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 128580,
      "end_ms": 129900,
      "text": "都不是外人怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 130180,
      "end_ms": 131660,
      "text": "领导您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 131660,
      "end_ms": 132360,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 132500,
      "end_ms": 134160,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 134300,
      "end_ms": 136660,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 136660,
      "end_ms": 138780,
      "text": "当领导在客户面前夸你怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 139020,
      "end_ms": 139840,
      "text": "火车跑得快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 139860,
      "end_ms": 140800,
      "text": "全靠车头带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 140940,
      "end_ms": 142640,
      "text": "还请领导继续培养提携。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 142700,
      "end_ms": 144260,
      "text": "当领导夸你菜点的不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 144280,
      "end_ms": 144700,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 145020,
      "end_ms": 147120,
      "text": "多谢领导赏识我点的只是菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 147240,
      "end_ms": 148140,
      "text": "而领导您点的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 148140,
      "end_ms": 149665,
      "text": "可是公司前行的灯塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 149960,
      "end_ms": 151160,
      "text": "别人夸你衣服真好看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 151180,
      "end_ms": 151620,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 151920,
      "end_ms": 152425,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 152630,
      "end_ms": 153630,
      "text": "因为今天要见你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 153630,
      "end_ms": 154795,
      "text": "所以穿的好看一点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 155070,
      "end_ms": 155485,
      "text": "老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 155960,
      "end_ms": 157780,
      "text": "你是怎么做到见招拆招，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 158060,
      "end_ms": 159140,
      "text": "既不显得拍马屁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 159380,
      "end_ms": 161220,
      "text": "还能让领导听了这么舒服的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 161220,
      "end_ms": 163235,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 163690,
      "end_ms": 166210,
      "text": "你要知道这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 166210,
      "end_ms": 167150,
      "text": "那些会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 167150,
      "end_ms": 168050,
      "text": "会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 168150,
      "end_ms": 169230,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 169310,
      "end_ms": 170010,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 170010,
      "end_ms": 170730,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 170830,
      "end_ms": 171870,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 172130,
      "end_ms": 173950,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 174070,
      "end_ms": 176110,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 176110,
      "end_ms": 177290,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 177490,
      "end_ms": 178790,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 178970,
      "end_ms": 181485,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 182000,
      "end_ms": 183220,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 183220,
      "end_ms": 184060,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 184120,
      "end_ms": 184260,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 184260,
      "end_ms": 186200,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 186260,
      "end_ms": 186800,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 187040,
      "end_ms": 188060,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 188080,
      "end_ms": 189240,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 189240,
      "end_ms": 190680,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 190700,
      "end_ms": 192180,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 192360,
      "end_ms": 193240,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 193240,
      "end_ms": 195600,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 195600,
      "end_ms": 196685,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 196950,
      "end_ms": 198030,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 198030,
      "end_ms": 199130,
      "text": "强将手下无弱兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 199210,
      "end_ms": 200450,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 200470,
      "end_ms": 201650,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 201650,
      "end_ms": 203530,
      "text": "这个真是让我欲解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 203670,
      "end_ms": 204904,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 205250,
      "end_ms": 208230,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 208450,
      "end_ms": 211195,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 211370,
      "end_ms": 212550,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 212830,
      "end_ms": 214150,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 214250,
      "end_ms": 216410,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 216490,
      "end_ms": 217490,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 217630,
      "end_ms": 219685,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0b6a297a846159f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 219930,
      "end_ms": 221435,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
